      <li itemprop="definitions" itemscope repeat>
        <span itemprop="subject">the annealing/stretching temperatures for a polypropylene film</span>
        <span itemprop="definition">would be in the range of 120-125° C. (inventive process), compared to range of 140-150° C. (standard process), and for a polyethylene film about 110° C. (inventive process compared to about 115° C. (standard process).</span>
        <meta itemprop="num_attr" content="">
