        <span itemprop="definition">were stretched as 16-ply films (8 rolls of 2 ply from an extruded tubular precursor). Alternatively, the annealed precursor films may be stretched as an 8-ply film or 24-ply film.</span>
        <meta itemprop="num_attr" content="">
      </li>
