    <div class="description-paragraph">The annealed precursor films are stretched to form microporous membranes. The annealed precursor films were stretched as 16-ply films (8 rolls of 2 ply from an extruded tubular precursor). Alternatively, the annealed precursor films may be stretched as an 8-ply film or 24-ply film. The stretching conditions are set forth in TABLE 6:</div>
